export anchor DarkEnterpriseStyle:
    number: 237
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dark enterprise
    idea:
        A formal dark suite shell with an app switcher bar, a tree navigation
        that opens Projects into its six projects, breadcrumbs and a command
        bar, square live tiles and a dense sortable data grid, all square and
        quietly blue.
    base: dark
    palette:
        base: #101317, the page behind the content and the style sheet
        shell: #181c21, the suite bar, the tree pane and the command bar
        panel: #1d2228, tiles, the grid and panels
        header: #242a31, grid header rows, panel title bars, the search box and the current tree item
        line: #343c45, every border, grid rule and tree guide
        ink: #e6e9ed, text and figures
        muted: #a2acb8, labels, meta, column headers and axis text
        blue: #5aa6f7, links, the current tree edge, this week columns, meters and focus
        action: #2a68b5, the primary button fill behind white text
        slate: #6f7c8b, last week columns
        ok: #6fd08c, On track text and check circle
        risk: #f0c24e, At risk text and triangle
        bad: #ff8f85, Behind and overdue text, crossed square and clock
    type:
        One system UI stack, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, sans-serif. Base 13px at 1.4. The page title greeting is 24px
        at 600, tile figures 40px at 300 light with tabular numbers, panel
        title bars 14px at 600, grid cells and tree items 13px, breadcrumbs
        and meta 12px, and column headers 11px caps at 600 tracked 0.06em.
    layout:
        A full shell. A 44px suite bar holds a square app grid button, the
        Brightwork name, an app switcher of Tracker, Canvas, Drive, Code and
        Ops with Tracker underlined, a centred square search box, a bell and
        Mara Okafor with a square initials tile. Under it a 248px tree pane
        lists Home as current with a blue left edge, Projects open with tree
        guides to its six projects, each with a small status shape, then
        Tasks, Team, Reports and Settings. The content area starts with a
        command bar holding a blue New project button, Export, Refresh and a
        view label, then breadcrumbs Brightwork, Home, Overview. The greeting
        is the page title with the date beside it, then a message bar with a
        4px coral left edge reading 4 tasks are overdue with a clock and a
        Review link. Four square tiles sit in a row, each a caps label, a 40px
        light figure and an icon, overdue with a coral edge. The projects are
        a dense data grid with a title bar, column headers with sort marks,
        and columns for project, department, status, progress, tasks and due.
        Last, two panels with grey title bars side by side, a column chart of
        all fourteen days in sequence with a dashed divider between the weeks,
        slate last week and blue this week, and an activity grid with time,
        person and event columns. Below 960px the tree pane collapses to a row
        of nav buttons, tiles go two by two and the grid scrolls inside its
        panel.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 12px panel padding, 8px by 12px grid cells, 16px between blocks.
    density: Dense. Many rows and small type, everything visible at once on a laptop.
    corners: Square everywhere, 0px on tiles, panels, buttons and fields.
    borders:
        1px line around every pane, panel and grid row. A 3px blue edge marks
        the current tree item and a 4px coral edge marks the message bar.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from four flat greys stepping from base to header.
    icons:
        Fine line icons at 1.5px stroke, 16px. Status uses a check circle, a
        triangle with a bang and a crossed square, always with the word,
        overdue a clock.
    focus: A 2px blue outline inset by 1px inside grid rows and offset 2px elsewhere.
    tone: Formal and exact, such as Overview, Projects, 6 items and Activity, last 24 hours.
